**CALLGRIND**, valgrind-3.26.0, warmup=0, and read with §5's caveat in force:

  photo_cid       512 p6 frame  1,511,695,713 -> 1,467,938,755  (-2.894 %)
                               port/C **2.142 -> 2.080** (C 705,588,240)
  screen_terminal 512 p6 frame    893,944,001 ->   850,187,043  (-4.895 %)

  the KERNEL, photo_cid p6 self Ir:
    base  wiener_convolve_add_src 20,027,200 + {closure#1} 37,844,928
          = 57,872,128
    cand  __arcane_wiener_convolve_simd_v3 8,476,432 + {closure#1} 5,377,216
          + the dispatch shell 52,935 = 13,906,583   (**-75.97 %**)
