LIVE** — they are native runs on r7900x, so `X64V4Token::summon()` succeeds and
the AVX-512 arm is what encoded the bytes. That makes the x86 column a direct
byte-identity result for the new tier on ~1,600 encoded cells, not only for the
`_v3` arm the callgrind numbers priced.

